This software and the used libraries are copyrighted by various authors under various licenses.

"Lovely Screensaver" is defined as all files with the extension ".lua" within the base directory of this repository.
"Libraries" (singular "Library") are various third-party scripts located in the "lib" directory and carry separate licenses.

The authorship information, license year and type, and web page (where applicable) of Lovely Screensaver and its
external libraries is located in the "Auhorship" section.

The full license texts of all used and developed software is listed in the "License Texts" section. These license
texts are grouped by "license name"s and are the full license texts provided by the original firms who created
the license texts.

